{"seq":2,"slug":"managing-the-context-window","title":"管理上下文窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/context-engineering-for-codebases/structuring-and-delivering-context/managing-the-context-window","wordCount":1500,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"管理上下文窗口\">管理上下文窗口</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>上下文窗口不是无限的仓库，而是按 token 计价的稀缺预算。Anthropic 的上下文工程文章给出过最直接的类比：LLM 有一个「注意力预算」（attention budget），解析大量上下文时每引入一个新 token 都在消耗它（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-context-engineering-for-ai-agents\">Effective context engineering for AI agents</a>）。所以窗口工程的关键变量不是「能装多少」，而是<strong>什么值得占一份预算、何时占用、占用多久</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上下文窗口是稀缺预算\">上下文窗口是稀缺预算</h2><p>容量本身正在快速膨胀，但这加重而非减轻管理负担：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型 / 系统</th>\n<th>窗口规模</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Google Gemini 2.5 Pro</td>\n<td>100 万 token（官方称 200 万即将推出）</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://blog.google/technology/google-deepmind/gemini-model-thinking-updates-march-2025/\">Google 官方博客</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meta Llama 4 Scout</td>\n<td>1000 万 token（同代 Maverick 为 100 万）</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-4-Scout-17B-16E-Instruct\">官方模型卡</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude 系列</td>\n<td>已出现原生 1M 窗口模型；Claude Code 可用 <code>CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_1M_CONTEXT</code> 把它们压回 200K 窗口运行</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">Claude Code Changelog</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>膨胀没有消除零和性：被无关内容占据的预算，就是相关内容拿不到的预算。更关键的是两个实证发现。<strong>中部遗忘</strong>：Liu et al. 的实验显示，语言模型主要利用长上下文开头与结尾的信息，埋在中部的关键事实召回率显著下降（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172\">arXiv:2307.03172</a>）。<strong>Context Rot</strong>：Chroma research 的同名报告测量了输入 token 增加时多个模型的表现，结论是性能随输入增长而衰减——即便远未触及窗口上限（<a href=\"https://www.trychroma.com/research/context-rot\">Context Rot 报告</a>）。</p>\n<p>注意力稀释有架构层面的解释：注意力权重经 softmax 归一化，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{N} a_i = 1 \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad \\bar{a} = \\frac{1}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>token 总数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，单个 token 平均分到的注意力份额越小。「预算」在这里是字面义，不是修辞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"更多上下文-常常更糟\">「更多上下文」常常更糟</h2><p>堆料帮倒忙的机理如今可以逐条对上证据：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>噪音稀释信号</strong>：softmax 归一意味着任何低相关 token 都在物理上分走关键信息的注意力；「先从噪音里找信号」本身就是额外的出错面。</li>\n<li><strong>过期与矛盾制造混乱</strong>：新旧两版约定同时在场时，模型无从仲裁；质量不齐的多不如干净一致的少。</li>\n<li><strong>无关暗示诱发跑偏</strong>：上下文不只是数据也是提示，塞入无关代码会把行为引向不该去的方向。</li>\n<li><strong>精炼是设计而非删减</strong>：Anthropic 把「对逼近极限的对话做摘要、以摘要重启新窗口」定义为 compaction，并把结构化笔记与 sub-agent 架构列为并列的缓解手段（同上工程文）——所有这些手段的共同前提都是承认窗口有限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>值得强调的反直觉之处：上述结论在 8K 窗口时代成立，在百万窗口时代依然成立——Context Rot 测的正是大窗口内部的衰减，窗口变大不等于利用率变高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产工具的窗口治理机制\">生产工具的窗口治理机制</h2><p>Claude Code 把「逼近极限之后怎么办」做成了显式流水线（依据 <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/how-claude-code-works\">how-claude-code-works</a> 与 <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/model-config\">model-config</a> 文档）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;用量逼近 auto-compact 窗口&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;先清理较旧的工具输出&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;仍然吃紧?&quot;}&#10;    C -- &quot;否&quot; --&gt; Z[&quot;继续工作&quot;]&#10;    C -- &quot;是&quot; --&gt; D[&quot;生成历史摘要并重启上下文&lt;br/&gt;保留用户请求与关键代码片段&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;单个文件或工具输出过大&lt;br/&gt;摘要后立即再次填满?&quot;}&#10;    E -- &quot;连续数个回合如此&quot; --&gt; F[&quot;停止 auto-compact 并报错&lt;br/&gt;避免压缩循环空转&quot;]&#10;    E -- &quot;否&quot; --&gt; Z\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"用量逼近 auto-compact 窗口\"] --&gt; B[\"先清理较旧的工具输出\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"仍然吃紧?\"}\n    C -- \"否\" --&gt; Z[\"继续工作\"]\n    C -- \"是\" --&gt; D[\"生成历史摘要并重启上下文&lt;br/&gt;保留用户请求与关键代码片段\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"单个文件或工具输出过大&lt;br/&gt;摘要后立即再次填满?\"}\n    E -- \"连续数个回合如此\" --&gt; F[\"停止 auto-compact 并报错&lt;br/&gt;避免压缩循环空转\"]\n    E -- \"否\" --&gt; Z</pre><p>可操作的接口包括：不设窗口时默认在对话逼近模型上下文上限处自动压缩；<code>/autocompact</code> 可把压缩窗口显式设为 100K–1M token 区间内的值（如 <code>/autocompact 500k</code>）；<code>/compact 重点保留 API 变更</code> 这样的焦点参数告诉摘要器保留什么；CLAUDE.md 里也可写持久的「Compact Instructions」小节；<code>/context</code> 用于查看空间都被谁占据；切换到不相关任务时 <code>/clear</code> 直接归零。若单文件或工具输出大到「摘要一次立刻又满」，auto-compact 会在几次尝试后主动停机报错而不是无限循环。API 层面还有对应的 context editing 能力：按策略选择性清除历史中的旧工具结果与 thinking block（<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/context-editing\">平台文档</a>）。</p>\n<p>压缩效果可用比值衡量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>orig</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>summary</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = |C_{\\text{orig}}| \\,/\\, |C_{\\text{summary}}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">orig</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">summary</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 过小说明摘要没省出空间；过大则要警惕关键约束在摘要中被抹掉。两种失效都真实存在，这正是「焦点压缩」「Compact Instructions」这类把裁剪标准交还用户的接口存在的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为信噪比而优化\">为信噪比而优化</h2><p>把机制收拢成一个目标函数：优化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>相关</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>噪音</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SNR} = S_{\\text{相关}} / N_{\\text{噪音}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">相关</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">噪音</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而非总信息量。各手段分工明确——常驻文件瘦身是每一轮请求都生效的节省；过期内容清理是与新增等价的减法；按需检索把预算留给当下任务（下一篇展开）；压缩与清理流水线则是超限后的兜底。权衡同样清晰：过度压缩省了预算却可能丢掉早期指令，Claude Code 文档因此提醒持久规则应写进 CLAUDE.md 而不是指望对话历史永远在场。省预算与保关键信息之间的张力不可消除，只能靠焦点参数显式裁决。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li>先看账单再优化：<code>/context</code> 查占用构成；长会话定期 <code>/clear</code>，切任务必清。</li>\n<li>给 <code>/autocompact</code> 设显式窗口（如 <code>500k</code>），别让默认阈值替你做预算决策。</li>\n<li>常驻指引文件控制在 200 行内，详细工作流移入按需加载的技能或路径规则。</li>\n<li>大体积工具输出（全量日志、完整测试输出）交给 sub-agent 或落盘后按需 head/tail，不让原始输出常驻主对话。</li>\n<li>面对超大单文件分析，提前拆分输入，不要依赖摘要兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>窗口管理的本质是预算纪律：容量在涨，注意力的边际价值在降。信噪比优先、清理有据、压缩有焦点——三件事都不需要等更大的窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../structuring-and-delivering-context/retrieval-and-just-in-time-context\">检索与按需上下文</a>：同章下一篇——按需供给从源头减少占用，压缩则是超限后的兜底，两者构成完整的供给策略。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../what-is-context-engineering/context-as-the-real-bottleneck\">上下文是真正的瓶颈</a>：本篇预算纪律的证据起点——context rot 与中部遗忘的实验细节在该篇铺陈。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../maintaining-context-over-time/keeping-context-fresh\">保持上下文新鲜</a>：compaction 之后哪些内容幸存、如何从磁盘重载——窗口治理的会话内新鲜度视角。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"管理上下文窗口","id":"管理上下文窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"上下文窗口是稀缺预算","id":"上下文窗口是稀缺预算"},{"level":2,"text":"「更多上下文」常常更糟","id":"更多上下文-常常更糟"},{"level":2,"text":"生产工具的窗口治理机制","id":"生产工具的窗口治理机制"},{"level":2,"text":"为信噪比而优化","id":"为信噪比而优化"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"分层与就近作用域","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/context-engineering-for-codebases/structuring-and-delivering-context/layered-and-scoped-context"},"next":{"title":"检索与按需上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/context-engineering-for-codebases/structuring-and-delivering-context/retrieval-and-just-in-time-context"}}